B.a1t=new A.a5("Introduction","Last updated: 11 November 2026\nThe Or\xe7amentos e Gest\xe3o app processes the data described in this policy. This policy covers this app only, under Brazil's LGPD and Google Play rules. Trade name: Or\xe7amentos e Gest\xe3o. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com.")
B.a0C=new A.a5("Controller and contact","For access, correction or deletion: suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
B.a06=new A.a5("What the app does","Or\xe7amentos e Gest\xe3o is operational management on the phone: commercial agenda (clients and suppliers), quotes, work orders, cash, PDFs and local backup. You can use operations without a required subscription. An optional Pro plan exists (Google Play Billing; price on Play). No in-app ads.")
B.a00=new A.a5("Storage","Business data stays on the device (SQLite). We do not automatically send clients, quotes, cash or PDFs to the developer's servers.\n\nWhen data may leave the device (only if you act)\n\n- Share or save PDF, business card, vCard or QR\n- Create and share a backup or export ZIP\n- Open links you choose (WhatsApp, email, Play Store, website)\n- Pick a logo with the system photo picker (no full-gallery access)")
B.a_V=new A.a5("Third-party services","- Firebase Analytics / Remote Config: generic usage events and version policy, without client names or money amounts.\n- Firebase Firestore: minimal technical record (device identifier / eligibility), without client files or cash movements.\n- Google Play Billing: only if you choose the optional Pro plan. Payments are handled by Google.\n- We do not use in-app ads or an advertising ID.")
B.a08=new A.a5("Notifications","Notifications, if any, are local on the device.")
B.a22=new A.a5("Rights","You can delete data in Settings or uninstall the app. Files you exported remain where you saved them. Firebase telemetry: request by email (up to 15 business days).")
B.a1o=new A.a5("Changes","Updates are published on this page. In-app reference version: kPublicLegalDocumentsVersion.")
B.a1Y=new A.a5("Legal identification (LGPD / Google Play)","Controller: PERFECT GEST DESENVOLVIMENTO DE SOFTWARE LTDA, CNPJ 66.889.409/0001-19. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com. Contact: suporte@perfectgestdev.com.")
