B.a1X=new A.a5("Introdu\xe7\xe3o","Last updated: 11 November 2026")
B.a1K=new A.a5("What is Or\xe7amentos e Gest\xe3o?","A phone app for day-to-day management with local SQLite data: agenda (clients and suppliers), quotes, work orders, cash and PDF. Website: https://perfectgestdev.com. No in-app ads.")
B.a25=new A.a5("Does it work offline?","Yes for daily use. Analytics, Remote Config and technical Firestore may use the network.")
B.a12=new A.a5("Is there a subscription?","Operations can be used without a required subscription. An optional Pro plan is available on Google Play (price in the store).")
